und color for the checkout page. Color is applied to the <em>body</em> element.' => 'Dewiswch liw cefndir ar gyfer y dudalen ddesg dalu. Mae lliw yn cael ei gymhwyso i elfen y <em>corff</em> .','Footer background color' => 'Lliw cefndir y troedyn','Choose a background color for the checkout page footer. Only applies when using the distraction free header and footer.' => 'Dewiswch liw cefndir ar gyfer troedyn y dudalen ddesg dalu. Dim ond wrth ddefnyddio&#39;r pennyn a&#39;r troedyn heb dynnu sylw y mae&#39;n berthnasol.','Progress bar' => 'Bar cynnydd','Display the checkout progress bar when using multi-step checkout layout' => 'Dangoswch y bar cynnydd desg dalu wrth ddefnyddio cynllun desg dalu aml-gam','Make the checkout progress bar stay visible while scrolling' => 'Gwnewch i&#39;r bar cynnydd til aros yn weladwy wrth sgrolio','Express checkout' => 'Desg dalu cyflym','Enable the express checkout section' => 'Galluogi&#39;r adran desg dalu cyflym','Displays the express checkout section at checkout when supported payment gateways have this feature enabled.' => 'Yn dangos yr adran desg dalu cyflym wrth y ddesg dalu pan fydd y nodwedd hon wedi&#39;i galluogi gan byrth talu â chymorth.','Display express checkout buttons in one line for larger screens' => 'Arddangos botymau desg dalu cyflym mewn un llinell ar gyfer sgriniau mwy','Ignore additional checkout required fields when paying with a compatible express checkout payment gateway' => 'Anwybyddwch feysydd talu ychwanegol wrth dalu gyda phorth talu desg dalu cyflym cydnaws','Make the order summary stay visible while scrolling' => 'Gwnewch i grynodeb y gorchymyn aros yn weladwy wrth sgrolio','Choose a background color for the order summary section.' => 'Dewiswch liw cefndir ar gyfer yr adran crynodeb archeb.','Highlight the order totals row in the order summary table' => 'Amlygwch y rhes cyfansymiau trefn yn y tabl crynodeb trefn','Most useful when the order summary section does not have a highlighted background color. Might also apply to the Cart, Order Received and View Order pages when using Fluid Checkout PRO.' => 'Yn fwyaf defnyddiol pan nad oes gan yr adran crynodeb trefn liw cefndir wedi&#39;i amlygu. Gallai hefyd fod yn berthnasol i&#39;r tudalennau Cert, Archeb a Dderbynnir a Gweld Archeb wrth ddefnyddio Fluid Checkout PRO.','Action link on the order summary at checkout.' => 'Dolen gweithredu ar grynodeb yr archeb wrth y ddesg dalu.','Edit cart link' => 'Golygu dolen cart','Cart items count' => 'Mae eitemau cart yn cyfrif','Link to shop page' => 'Dolen i dudalen siop','Cart items' => 'Eitemau cert','Hide cart items errors at the checkout page' => 'Cuddio gwallau eitemau cart ar y dudalen ddesg dalu','Do not display the cart items errors message at the top of the checkout page. When submitting the checkout form to complete the purchase, these error messages will always be displayed.' => 'Peidiwch ag arddangos y neges gwallau eitemau cart ar frig y dudalen ddesg dalu. Wrth gyflwyno&#39;r ffurflen ddesg dalu i gwblhau&#39;r pryniant, bydd y negeseuon gwall hyn bob amser yn cael eu harddangos.','Place order' => 'Rhowch archeb','Define the position to display "Place order" and terms checkbox section.' => 'Diffiniwch y sefyllfa i arddangos &quot;Trefn lle&quot; a thelerau adran blwch ticio.','Some options might not be compatible with some plugins and themes.' => 'Efallai na fydd rhai opsiynau yn gydnaws â rhai ategion a themâu.','Below the payment section' => 'Isod yr adran talu','Below the order summary' => 'Isod y crynodeb archeb','Both below the payment section and the order summary' => 'Mae&#39;r ddau islaw&#39;r adran dalu a chrynodeb yr archeb','Add widget areas to the checkout page' => 'Ychwanegu ardaloedd teclyn i&#39;r dudalen ddesg dalu','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the checkout page.' => 'Defnyddir yr ardaloedd teclyn hyn i ychwanegu symbolau ymddiriedaeth a bathodynnau ymddiriedaeth ar y dudalen ddesg dalu.','Display the coupon codes section title' => 'Dangoswch deitl yr adran codau cwpon','Select position where to display the coupon codes section on the checkout page.' => 'Dewiswch leoliad lle i arddangos yr adran codau cwpon ar y dudalen ddesg dalu.','Before the checkout steps' => 'Cyn y camau til','As a substep before payment methods' => 'Fel is-gam cyn dulliau talu','As a substep after payment methods' => 'Fel is-gam ar ôl dulliau talu','Default button style' => 'Arddull botwm diofyn','"Add" link button' => 'Botwm cyswllt &quot;Ychwanegu&quot;.','Checkout fields' => 'Meysydd desg dalu','Optional fields' => 'Meysydd dewisol','Hide optional fields behind a link button' => 'Cuddio meysydd dewisol y tu ôl i fotwm cyswllt','It is recommended to keep this option checked to reduce the number of open input fields, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#1-address-line-2--company-name-can-safely-be-collapsed-behind-a-link" target="_blank">read the research</a>.' => 'Argymhellir cadw&#39;r opsiwn hwn wedi&#39;i wirio i leihau nifer y meysydd mewnbwn agored, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#1-address-line-2--company-name-can-safely-be-collapsed-behind-a-link" target="_blank">darllenwch yr ymchwil</a> .','Do not hide "Address line 2" fields behind a link button' => 'Peidiwch â chuddio meysydd &quot;Llinell cyfeiriad 2&quot; y tu ôl i fotwm cyswllt','Recommended only when most customers actually need the "Address line 2" field, or when getting the right shipping address is crucial (ie. if delivering food and other perishable products).' => 'Argymhellir dim ond pan fo&#39;r rhan fwyaf o gwsmeriaid mewn gwirionedd angen y maes &quot;Llinell Cyfeiriad 2&quot;, neu pan fydd cael y cyfeiriad cludo cywir yn hanfodol (hy os ydynt yn danfon bwyd a chynhyrchion darfodus eraill).','Billing address' => 'Cyfeiriad bilio','Select position where to display the billing address section on the checkout page.' => 'Dewiswch safle lle i arddangos yr adran cyfeiriad bilio ar y dudalen ddesg dalu.','As a step before shipping' => 'Fel cam cyn llongau','As a sub-step before the shipping address section' => 'Fel is-gam cyn yr adran cyfeiriad llongau','As a sub-step after the shipping address section' => 'Fel is-gam ar ôl yr adran cyfeiriad llongau','As a step after shipping' => 'Fel cam ar ôl cludo','As a sub-step before the payment section' => 'Fel is-gam cyn yr adran dalu','Force billing and shipping addresses to the same (single section)' => 'Gorfodi cyfeiriadau bilio a chludo i&#39;r un peth (adran sengl)','Checkbox for "Same as shipping/billing address" checked by default' => 'Blwch ticio ar gyfer &quot;Yr un fath â&#39;r cyfeiriad cludo / bilio&quot; wedi&#39;i wirio yn ddiofyn','The checkbox "Same as shiping address" will start as checked by default when the shipping address section is displayed first. <br>The checkbox "Same as billing address" will start as checked by default when the billing address section is displayed first. <br> It is recommended to leave this option checked as to significantly reduce the number of open input fields at checkout, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#3-default-billing--shipping-and-hide-the-fields-entirely" target="_blank">read the research</a>.' => 'Bydd y blwch ticio &quot;Yr un fath â&#39;r cyfeiriad cludo&quot; yn dechrau fel y&#39;i gwiriwyd yn ddiofyn pan fydd yr adran cyfeiriad cludo yn cael ei harddangos gyntaf.<br> Bydd y blwch ticio &quot;Yr un fath â&#39;r cyfeiriad bilio&quot; yn dechrau fel y&#39;i gwiriwyd yn ddiofyn pan fydd yr adran cyfeiriad bilio yn cael ei harddangos gyntaf.<br> Argymhellir gadael yr opsiwn hwn wedi&#39;i wirio i leihau&#39;n sylweddol nifer y meysydd mewnbwn agored wrth y ddesg dalu, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#3-default-billing--shipping-and-hide-the-fields-entirely" target="_blank">darllenwch yr ymchwil</a> .','Highlight the billing address section in the checkout form' => 'Tynnwch sylw at yr adran cyfeiriad bilio yn y ffurflen ddesg dalu','Shipping address' => 'Cyfeiriad cludo','Highlight the shipping address section in the checkout form' => 'Tynnwch sylw at yr adran cyfeiriad cludo yn y ffurflen ddesg dalu','Shipping methods' => 'Dulliau cludo','Choose in which position to display the shipping methods section.' => 'Dewiswch ym mha safle i arddangos yr adran dulliau cludo.','Before shipping address' => 'Cyfeiriad cyn cludo','After shipping address' => 'Ar ôl cyfeiriad cludo','Local pickup' => 'Pickup lleol','Removes shipping address section when a local pickup shipping method is selected.' => 'Yn dileu&#39;r adran cyfeiriad cludo pan ddewisir dull cludo casglu lleol.','Replaces the shipping address with the pickup point location when a local pickup shipping method is selected.' => 'Yn disodli&#39;r cyfeiriad cludo gyda lleoliad y pwynt codi pan ddewisir dull cludo lleol.','Choose which address to save as the shipping address for local pickup orders.' => 'Dewiswch pa gyfeiriad i&#39;w gadw fel y cyfeiriad cludo ar gyfer archebion casglu lleol.','Save the selected pickup location' => 'Arbedwch y lleoliad casglu a ddewiswyd','Save same as the billing address' => 'Arbedwch yr un peth â&#39;r cyfeiriad bilio','Do not save any shipping address' => 'Peidiwch ag arbed unrhyw gyfeiriad cludo','Company name field for shipping address' => 'Maes enw cwmni ar gyfer cyfeiriad cludo','Change visibility for the company name field for the shipping address section on the checkout form.' => 'Newid gwelededd ar gyfer maes enw&#39;r cwmni ar gyfer yr adran cyfeiriad cludo ar y ffurflen ddesg dalu.','If field is set as "optional", which is the default visibility state, no changes will be applied to let other plugins apply any changes they need.' => 'Os yw&#39;r maes wedi&#39;i osod fel &quot;dewisol&quot;, sef y cyflwr gwelededd rhagosodedig, ni fydd unrhyw newidiadau yn cael eu cymhwyso i adael i ategion eraill gymhwyso unrhyw newidiadau sydd eu hangen arnynt.','Hidden (remove field)' => 'Cudd (tynnwch y maes)','Optional' => 'Dewisol','Required' => 'Angenrheidiol','Add shipping phone field to the checkout form.' => 'Ychwanegu maes ffôn cludo i&#39;r ffurflen ddesg dalu.','Choose in which step to display the shipping phone field.' => 'Dewiswch ym mha gam i arddangos y maes ffôn cludo.','Contact step' => 'Cam cyswllt','Billing phone' => 'Ffôn bilio','Add billing phone field to the checkout form.' => 'Ychwanegu maes ffôn bilio at y ffurflen ddesg dalu.','Choose in which step to display the billing phone field.' => 'Dewiswch ym mha gam i arddangos y maes ffôn bilio.','Show country code beside the flag' => 'Dangos cod gwlad wrth ymyl y faner','Show an example of a valid phone number inside phone fields' => 'Dangoswch enghraifft o rif ffôn dilys y tu mewn i feysydd ffôn','Do not change placeholders' => 'Peidiwch â newid dalfannau','Show if not defined' => 'Dangoswch os nad yw wedi&#39;i ddiffinio','Always show' => 'Dangoswch bob amser','Order notes' => 'Nodiadau archebu','Define the visibility of the additional order notes field.' => 'Diffiniwch welededd y maes nodiadau archeb ychwanegol.','Gift options' => 'Opsiynau rhodd','Allow customers to add a gift message and other gift related options to the order.' => 'Caniatáu i gwsmeriaid ychwanegu neges anrheg ac opsiynau eraill sy&#39;n gysylltiedig â rhoddion at yr archeb.','Display the gift message as part of the order details table instead of a separate section' => 'Dangoswch y neges anrheg fel rhan o dabl manylion yr archeb yn lle adran ar wahân','This option affects the order confirmation page (thank you page) and order details on account pages, emails and packing slips.' => 'Mae&#39;r opsiwn hwn yn effeithio ar y dudalen cadarnhau archeb (tudalen diolch) a manylion archebu ar dudalennau cyfrifon, e-byst a slipiau pacio.','Account matching' => 'Paru cyfrif','Enable the account matching feature' => 'Galluogi&#39;r nodwedd paru cyfrif','Associate the guest customer\'s orders with their existing account when an account already exists with the customer\'s contact details.' => 'Cysylltwch archebion y cwsmer gwadd â&#39;u cyfrif presennol pan fo cyfrif eisoes yn bodoli gyda manylion cyswllt y cwsmer.','Display message when an account exists with the email address provided' => 'Dangos neges pan fydd cyfrif yn bodoli gyda&#39;r cyfeiriad e-bost a ddarparwyd','Replaces the account creation fields with a notification and option to log in. In some contexts, it might be recommended to leave this option disabled to protect the privacy of customers.' => 'Yn disodli&#39;r meysydd creu cyfrif gyda hysbysiad ac opsiwn i fewngofnodi. Mewn rhai cyd-destunau, efallai yr argymhellir gadael yr opsiwn hwn wedi&#39;i analluogi er mwyn diogelu preifatrwydd cwsmeriaid.','Dashboard' => 'Dangosfwrdd','Integrations' => 'Integreiddiadau','License keys' => 'Allweddi trwydded','Visit our website for more information about our plugins and add-ons.' => 'Ewch i&#39;n gwefan i gael rhagor o wybodaeth am ein ategion ac ychwanegion.','Order pay page' => 'Archebwch dudalen talu','Order pay' => 'Archebu tâl','Enable order pay page optimizations' => 'Galluogi optimeiddio tudalennau talu archeb','Changes the layout of order pay page for existing orders pending payment from the customer.' => 'Yn newid cynllun tudalen dalu archeb ar gyfer archebion presennol tra&#39;n aros am daliad gan y cwsmer.','Add widget areas to the order pay page' => 'Ychwanegu ardaloedd teclyn i&#39;r dudalen talu archeb','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the order pay page.' => 'Defnyddir yr ardaloedd teclyn hyn i ychwanegu symbolau ymddiriedaeth a bathodynnau ymddiriedaeth ar y dudalen talu archeb.','Thank you page & order details layout' => 'Tudalen diolch a gosodiad manylion archeb','Order details optimizations' => 'Gorchymyn optimeiddio manylion','Enable thank you page and order details optimizations' => 'Galluogi optimeiddio tudalen diolch a manylion archebu','Changes the layout of order details on the thank you page and account pages.' => 'Yn newid cynllun manylion archeb ar y dudalen diolch a thudalennau cyfrif.','Enable order details customizations on email notifications' => 'Galluogi addasiadau manylion archeb ar hysbysiadau e-bost','Display new sections and change order of sections on email notifications. Styles of order details on email notifications remain unchanged.' => 'Arddangos adrannau newydd a newid trefn adrannau ar hysbysiadau e-bost. Mae arddulliau manylion archeb ar hysbysiadau e-bost yn parhau heb eu newid.','Thank you page' => 'Tudalen diolch','These options affect the thank you page, also known as order received or order confirmation pages.' => 'Mae&#39;r opsiynau hyn yn effeithio ar y dudalen diolch, a elwir hefyd yn dudalennau cadarnhad archeb neu archeb.','Order details layout' => 'Cynllun manylion archeb','Display the order details with wide layout on the thank you page' => 'Dangoswch fanylion yr archeb gyda chynllun eang ar y dudalen diolch','Add widget areas to the thank you page' => 'Ychwanegu ardaloedd teclyn i&#39;r dudalen diolch','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the thank you page.' => 'Defnyddir yr ardaloedd teclyn hyn i ychwanegu symbolau ymddiriedaeth a bathodynnau ymddiriedaeth ar y dudalen diolch.','Order actions' => 'Gorchymyn gweithredoedd','Choose in which position to display the order actions.' => 'Dewiswch ym mha safle i arddangos gweithredoedd y drefn.','Inside the order overview' => 'Y tu mewn i&#39;r trosolwg gorchymyn','After the order overview' => 'Ar ôl trosolwg y gorchymyn','After order sections' => 'Adrannau ar ôl gorchymyn','Order status' => 'Statws archeb','Display the order status progress bar' => 'Dangoswch y bar cynnydd statws archeb','Choose in which position to display the section.' => 'Dewiswch ym mha safle i arddangos yr adran.','After the order overview and payment instructions' => 'Ar ôl y trosolwg archeb a chyfarwyddiadau talu','Before the order items section' => 'Cyn yr adran eitemau archeb','Inside the order items section' => 'Y tu mewn i&#39;r adran eitemau archeb','After the order items section' => 'Ar ôl yr adran eitemau archeb','On the sidebar' => 'Ar y bar ochr','Order downloads' => 'Archebwch lawrlwythiadau','Gift message' => 'Neges anrheg','Tools' => 'Offer','Troubleshooting' => 'Datrys problemau','Debug options' => 'Opsiynau dadfygio','Debug mode' => 'Modd dadfygio','Using debug mode affects the website performance. Only use this option while troubleshooting.' => 'Mae defnyddio modd dadfygio yn effeithio ar berfformiad y wefan. Defnyddiwch yr opsiwn hwn wrth ddatrys problemau yn unig.','Load unminified assets' => 'Llwytho asedau heb eu miniogi','Enhanced select fields' => 'Gwell meysydd dethol','Fix automatic zoom-in on form fields' => 'Trwsio chwyddo awtomatig ar feysydd ffurflen','Set <code>font-size</code> inside form fields to 16px' => 'Gosod <code>font-size</code> y tu mewn i feysydd ffurflen i 16px','Fluid Checkout' => 'Desg Hylif','Settings' => 'Gosodiadau','Support' => 'Cefnogaeth','<a target="_blank" href="%s">Upgrade to PRO</a> to unlock more options.' => '<a target="_blank" href="%s">Uwchraddio i PRO</a> i ddatgloi mwy o opsiynau.','(PRO)' => '(PRO)','(experimental)' => '(arbrofol)','Please verify your phone number.' => 'Gwiriwch eich rhif ffôn.','The Bluehost Plugin' => 'Yr Ategyn Bluehost','Custom fields' => 'Meysydd personol','Enable custom shipping email field' => 'Galluogi maes e-bost cludo personol','When enabled, the shipping email field from the Bluehost plugin will be added to the checkout form.' => 'Pan fydd wedi&#39;i alluogi, bydd y maes e-bost cludo o&#39;r ategyn Bluehost yn cael ei ychwanegu at y ffurflen ddesg dalu.','Captcha Pro by BestWebSoft' => 'Captcha Pro gan BestWebSoft','Captcha position' => 'Safle Captcha','Define the position to display the captcha section. Some positions might not work depending on the captcha type chosen.' => '