abled when using the Biteship plugin.' => 'Mae&#39;r nodwedd dewis meysydd gwell bob amser wedi&#39;i hanalluogi wrth ddefnyddio&#39;r ategyn Biteship.','The place order position is always set to "Below the order summary" when using German Market. That plugin requires the place order button and legal checkboxes to be displayed below the order summary.' => 'Mae safle gosod yr archeb bob amser wedi&#39;i osod i &quot;Islaw crynodeb yr archeb&quot; wrth ddefnyddio&#39;r Farchnad Almaenig. Mae&#39;r ategyn hwnnw&#39;n gofyn am arddangos y botwm gosod archeb a&#39;r blychau gwirio cyfreithiol o dan grynodeb yr archeb.','The place order position is always set to "Below the order summary" when using Germanized for WooCommerce. That plugin requires the place order button and legal checkboxes to be displayed below the order summary.' => 'Mae safle&#39;r archeb bob amser wedi&#39;i osod i &quot;Islaw crynodeb yr archeb&quot; wrth ddefnyddio Almaeneg ar gyfer WooCommerce. Mae&#39;r ategyn hwnnw&#39;n gofyn am arddangos y botwm archeb a&#39;r blychau gwirio cyfreithiol o dan grynodeb yr archeb.','Edit pickup locations' => 'Golygu lleoliadau casglu','Use local pickup label from WooCommerce settings' => 'Defnyddiwch label casglu lleol o osodiadau WooCommerce','When enabled, the pickup option label on checkout matches the title from WooCommerce pickup location settings. When disabled, the label uses the translatable "Local pickup" text from Fluid Checkout.' => 'Pan gaiff ei alluogi, mae&#39;r label opsiwn casglu wrth y ddesg dalu yn cyfateb i&#39;r teitl o osodiadau lleoliad casglu WooCommerce. Pan gaiff ei analluogi, mae&#39;r label yn defnyddio&#39;r testun &quot;Casglu lleol&quot; y gellir ei gyfieithu o Fluid Checkout.','Button label for applying coupon codesApply' => 'Ymgeisiwch','Checkout step titleContact' => 'Cysylltwch','Checkout step titleShipping' => 'Llongau','Checkout step titleBilling' => 'Bilio','Checkout step titlePayment' => 'Taliad','Checkout substep change 